  "statSections": [
    {
      "name": "Traits",
      "rulesText": "Incorporeal Movement. The avatar can move through other creatures and objects as if they were Difficult Terrain. It takes 5 (1d10) Force damage if it ends its turn inside an object."
    },
    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Multiattack. The avatar makes a number of Reaping Scythe attacks equal to half the summoner's Proficiency Bonus (rounded up).\n\nReaping Scythe. Melee Attack Roll: Automatic hit, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Slashing damage plus 4 (1d8) Necrotic damage."
    }
  ],
  "rulesText": "Medium Undead, Neutral evil\n\nAC 20\nInitiative +3 (13)\nHP Half the HP maximum of its summoner\nSpeed 60 ft., Fly 60 ft. (hover)\n\nImmunities Necrotic, Poison; Charmed, Exhaustion,\n\nFrightened, Paralyzed, Petrified, Poisoned, Unconscious\n\nSenses Truesight 60 ft., Passive Perception 13\nLanguages All languages known to its summoner\nCR None (XP 0; PB equals its summoner's)\n\nTraits\n\nIncorporeal Movement. The avatar can move through other creatures and objects as if they were Difficult Terrain. It takes 5 (1d10) Force damage if it ends its turn inside an object.\n\nActions\n\nMultiattack. The avatar makes a number of Reaping Scythe attacks equal to half the summoner's Proficiency Bonus (rounded up).\n\nReaping Scythe. Melee Attack Roll: Automatic hit, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Slashing damage plus 4 (1d8) Necrotic damage.",
